---
/**
 * Brand lockup at parity with the current site: the "S" tile plus the wordmark. The real
 * grain-silo mark replaces the tile in Phase 3 (it exists in the app and on Discord).
 */
---

<span class="logo" aria-hidden="true">S</span><span class="word">Silo</span>

<style>
  .logo {
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 19px;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-500), var(--green-700));
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
    margin-right: 10px;
  }
  .word {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1;
  }
</style>
